<b>Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</b> is a temporary <a href=\"/wiki/Summon\" title=\"Summon\">summon</a> created by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath_(Class_Action)\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath (Class Action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath (Class Action)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath_(Class_Action)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath (Class Action)\">Mind-Claw of Tu'narath (Class Action)</a>. \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>The mind-claw is a manifestation of <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\">Vlaakith's</a> rage in the form of a psionic blade. The blade, and any other copies of it, is automatically dismissed when <a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\">Ch'r'ai W'wargaz</a> dies. Knocking out Ch'r'ai W'wargaz will not cause the blades to be dismissed. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Attacks_and_actions\">Attacks and actions</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Psychic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/100px-Generic_Psychic.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/150px-Generic_Psychic.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/200px-Generic_Psychic.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp/100px-Generic_Psychic.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Psychic.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mindbreak\" title=\"Mindbreak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mindbreak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mindbreak\" title=\"Mindbreak\">Mindbreak</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<dl><div><div><b>Damage: 3~18</b></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png/27px-D6_Psychic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png/40px-D6_Psychic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png/54px-D6_Psychic.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png/27px-D6_Psychic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/D6_Psychic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">3d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a></div></div></div></div></dl> Slice at a foe's psyche, allowing Inquisitor W'wargaz to possibly <a href=\"/wiki/Mindsteal_Link\" title=\"Mindsteal Link\">Mindsteal Link</a> with the target if they are not already affected.\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-footer\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\"> \n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd></dl>\n    </div></div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fly.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Fly.webp/100px-Fly.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Fly.webp/150px-Fly.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Fly.webp/200px-Fly.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Fly.webp/100px-Fly.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Fly.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/60px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/80px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\">Fly</a> (<span aria-label=\"Movement Speed (Half cost)\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Movement Speed (Half cost)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<p>Fly to a target position\n</p>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-footer\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\"> \n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n    </div></div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Upon a successful Mindbreak, W'wargaz will immediately use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mindsteal_Link\" title=\"Mindsteal Link\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mindsteal Link\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Generic_Debuff_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mindsteal_Link\" title=\"Mindsteal Link\">Mindsteal Link</a> as a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">reaction</a> on the target.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath\" title=\"Legendary Action: Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Mind